From 719c7b71c175c8ad52beed1d582c531f780476f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:36:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Evolver: make the About page ExpressiveOS's

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the About page described Evolution X,
linked its website, GitHub, Discord and X, listed its founders and team,
fetched its maintainers from Evolution X's OTA repo and read the
changelog from there. Describe ExpressiveOS, link its Telegram group and
GitHub, show its maintainer and read the changelog from ExpressiveOS's
OTA repo. Drop the translations whose text changed or went away.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
